  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": "1. Dissolve ingredients except sulfur, meat extract and sulfide, adjust pH to 5.0 - 5.5 with 2 N H2SO4 and sparge medium with 80% H2 and 20% CO2 gas mixture for 30 - 45 min to make it anoxic."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Distribute medium under the same gas atmosphere into anoxic Hungate-type tubes or serum vials already containing the appropriate amount of sulfur, only to 30% of their volume to allow for a large head space."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "comment": "For sterilization heat cultivation vessels in boiling water for 1 -2 hours on each of 3 successive days."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "comment": "Add meat extract and sulfide from sterile anoxic stock solutions prepared under 100% N2 gas atmosphere."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "comment": "After inoculation pressurize the vessels with sterile 80% H2 and 20% CO2 gas mixture to 2 bar overpressure."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "comment": "For DSM 18386 prepare medium without meat extract."
    }
  ]
}